:: About {"position":"850,0","size":"100,100"}
# ABOUT THE GAME

''(text-colour:cyan)[Welcome to the facility.]''

This is a text-based sci-fi puzzle adventure built in Twine. Explore corrupted terminals, decode security bypasses, and navigate hazardous sectors to survive.

---

### CREDITS & INFO

* **Developer:** On Paper Games
* **Engine:** Twine (Harlowe 3)
* **Status:** Beta

---

(align:"=><=")+(box:"X=")[*Note: AI was used as a tool to assist in this project, but the game is still fundamentally human-made. Thank you for playing!*]

---

''(text-colour:red)[This is still in progress. Thank you for your patience.]''
[[Want the code?]]
(text-size: 0.8)[© On Paper Games 2026. All rights reserved.]

<br>

[[Back|Start]]


:: Access Granted {"position":"675,1400","size":"100,100"}
*CLICK.* The lock disengages and the small box pops open.
Inside the override box, there is a remote control with 4 buttons.

* [[Press Button A|Drawer A]] 
* [[Press Button B|Drawer B]]
* [[Press Button C|Drawer C]]

<br>---<br>

(if: $clueA is true and $clueB is true and $clueC is true)[
  (text-colour:green)[With all 3 clues gathered, you notice the lock mechanisms under the rug align!]

  [[Unlock Hidden Trapdoor|Trapdoor Opened]]
](else:)[
  //There seems to be a locked trapdoor under the rug, but you still need more clues to figure out the sequence...//
]
<br>

[[Back|draw]]


