Robert: "Thank you so much! I'll take you to the others. Just follow me."

[[Follow Robert|office9]]


:: office9 {"position":"1675,575","size":"100,100"}
You meet the others, Linda and Thomas.

Thomas: "You work in archiving, huh?"

$playerName: "Yes. Yes, I do."

Thomas: "Well, we found a working computer down by Bay 005."

Linda: "We haven't been able to get far, though. We got our hands on a guest ID, but that only gave us limited access."

Robert: "You have an ID, so why don't we go down there and see if it works?"

$playerName: "But I'm on the lowest clearance level. I just joined!"

Linda: "Yes, but this is an old system, and it has security flaws. Any staff ID can get us somewhere."

$playerName: "It's worth a try, I guess."

